.gradle/
# Anchor Gradle output to the root and module-root build dirs only. Do NOT use
# an unanchored `build/` or `**/build/`: the production source package is
# build.raft.kuiklybase.datetime, so source lives under .../kotlin/build/raft/...
# and a generic build/ pattern would silently ignore the whole source tree.
/build/
/*/build/
local.properties
github-packages.properties
*.hprof
